<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY LEAGUE-NZ WIN THIRD TEST V BRITAIN, WIN SERIES 3-0.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-NZ WIN THIRD TEST V BRITAIN, WIN SERIES 3-0.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH, New Zealand 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand won</p>
<p>the third and final rugby league test against Britain 32-12</p>
<p>(halftime 20-6) on Friday to clinch the series 3-0.</p>
<p>Scorers</p>
<p>New Zealand - Tries: Sean Hoppe (2), John Timu, Ruben Wiki,</p>
<p>Gene Ngamu, Matthew Ridge. Goals: Matthew Ridge (4).</p>
<p>Britain - Tries: Denis Betts, Adrian Morley. Goals: Bobbie</p>
<p>Goulding (2).</p>
</text>
